  m_text: 'WELCOME TO YOUR FIRST DAY AS A NEWLY ELECTED REPRESENTATIVE


    Your
    job for the next 30 days is to pass or veto policies while maintaining your Approval
    rate above a 0 %. Easy enough right?\n\nDrag the YELLOW HIGHLIGHTER ot inspect
    bills(Costs 4AP)\n\nDrag the GREEN/RED STAMPS to vote. Whatch out for hidden
    corporate Riders. Or Dont and take the riches.\n\n You can blindly approve policies
    so be careful\n

    Drag the PHONE to the Rolodex (Top right corner) to spen
    money/AP.\n\nOne last thing, your desk will start cluttering if your approval
    rate is at or below 40%. Throw out these notes in the trash can on the bottom
    right.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
